<title>USA: Livingston Cty, Mich., won by Roney &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Livingston Cty, Mich., won by Roney &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roney &amp; Co. said it won $4.675 million of Livingston County, Mich., general obligation sanitary sewer system No. 1 bonds, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 5.449 percent.</p>
</text>
